A roundtable rule for proof, plus a five-step fix for governed KPIs.=0AA ro=
undtable rule for proof, plus a five-step fix for governed KPIs.=0AA chat b=
ox can answer an ERP question in four seconds. It still needs a governed=0A=
definition behind the number, a roundtable rule for proving it, and a one-p=
age=0Aconstitution that makes it reconcile every time.=0A=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=
=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=A0=E2=80=8C=C2=
